sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as SplashKit application
    participant Controller as SceneController
    participant Scene
    participant Name as NameEntity
    participant Part as RectangleEntity

    User->>App: Click canvas position
    App->>Controller: SelectNameAt(position)
    Controller->>Scene: FindTopmostNameAt(position)
    Scene->>Name: Contains(position)
    Name->>Part: Contains(position)
    Part-->>Name: hit result
    Name-->>Scene: hit result
    Scene-->>Controller: NameEntity or none
    Controller-->>App: selection result
    App-->>User: Show selection state

    User->>App: Press move/resize/recolor key
    App->>Controller: Apply action to selected name
    Controller->>Name: MoveBy / ResizeBy / ChangeColor
    Name->>Part: Apply operation to child shapes
    Part-->>Name: Updated part state
    App->>Scene: Draw(IDrawContext)
    Scene->>Name: Draw(IDrawContext)
    Name-->>App: Render composite through context
